cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "AgentBox: A disposable sandbox for every risky tool call"
abstract: >-
  AgentBox runs each risky tool call an AI agent makes in a short-lived microVM
  or WebAssembly sandbox with no network and no secrets by default, and checks
  the call's effects against a policy before anything is copied back.
authors:
